salt
{
  <b>ORE STUDIO - REPORTING</b>
  --
  <b>REPORTS: ACMCOR - Acme Corporation</b>
  --
  {
    <b>Party</b> ACMCOR | 14 definitions | (8 clean) | (2 carrying errors) | (1 failed) | (3 never run) | (0 running)
  }
  --
  {
    Filter [ All ] [ Failed ] [ Carrying errors ] [ Running ] [ Never run ] [ Clean ] | [ Refresh ] | Watching: live run events
  }
  --
  {#
    Report | Type | Schedule | Health | Errors | Started | Completed
    Group Consolidated Exposure | risk | scheduled 06:00 | completed clean | - | 06:00:02 | 06:04:31
    Group FX Hedges | risk | scheduled 06:00 | completed while carrying errors | (20 errors) | 06:00:02 | 06:07:18
    Group Intercompany Loans | risk | scheduled 06:00 | running | - | 08:12:44 | -
    Bucketed DV01 | risk | scheduled 06:00 | failed | - | 06:00:03 | 06:01:02
    Large Exposures | risk | on demand | never run | - | - | -
    Leverage Ratio | risk | scheduled 07:00 | completed clean | - | 07:00:01 | 07:03:40
    Headline Position | risk | on demand | completed clean | - | 07:41:12 | 07:42:55
    Intraday Risk Monitor | risk | on demand | completed while carrying errors | (11 errors) | 08:02:10 | 08:03:01
    Board Risk Dashboard | risk | scheduled 06:30 weekdays | failed | - | 06:30:01 | 06:30:09
  }
  --
  Summary: (2 completed carrying errors) | (1 running) | (1 never run in the shown page) | (2 failed)
  --
  Read-only. One row per report definition the party owns, with the health of its
  latest run. The five health words are never run, running, completed clean,
  completed while carrying errors, and failed. A run carrying errors is marked in
  the warning tone and states its count, so it is apart from a clean run without
  opening it; the report still succeeded. A definition with no run says so; it is
  not clean. The party comes from the session and every row is party-scoped by
  row-level security.
  --
  <b>A ROW THAT CHANGES WHILE THE SCREEN IS OPEN</b>
  --
  Group Intercompany Loans: running at 08:12:44, then completed while carrying
  errors at 08:15:02 with (3 errors). The row changes in place from the run
  update event; the person does not refresh.
  --
  <b>A PARTY THAT OWNS NO REPORT</b>
  --
  The header states the party and the table is replaced by one sentence: this
  party owns no report definition. An empty table is not shown.
}

